# SynapseIDS system user — THUGS(red) SynapseIDS
#
# Install:
#   install -m 0644 contrib/systemd/synapseids.sysusers /usr/lib/sysusers.d/synapseids.conf
#   systemd-sysusers            # or: systemd-sysusers /usr/lib/sysusers.d/synapseids.conf
#
# Creates an unprivileged, no-login system user+group that synapsed and
# synapse-sensor run as (PROJECT.md §21 — do not run the daemon as root).
# Run this BEFORE systemd-tmpfiles so the state directory can be chowned.
#
# Type Name    ID   GECOS                Home directory       Shell
u      synapse -    "SynapseIDS daemon"  /var/lib/synapseids  /usr/sbin/nologin
# The 'u' line already creates a matching group; declared explicitly for clarity.
g      synapse -
